cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "wieszcz-xix: a pre-1918 Polish corpus and a ladder of time-capsule language models"
message: "If you use this software, the corpus or the models, please cite the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kocur
    given-names: Szymon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3372-5133"
    email: me@szymonkocur.com
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
abstract: >-
  Code for building a 6.75-billion-token corpus of Polish text published between 1800 and
  1918, and for training a matched ladder of decoder-only language models on it from
  scratch. The pipeline covers crawling, OCR cleaning, deduplication, a temporal-bound
  audit, a document-level split tested for leakage, tokenizer training, pretraining, dense
  held-out evaluation, and the prejudice-prevalence measurement reported with the models.
keywords:
